My suggestion would be to put up the source code for parser and highlight on github, so that we can start a code discussion there. Given the size of the knitr community, several of us looking at it together should be helpful. In addition, I suggest we post the issue on stackoverflow, #rstats on twitter and any other avenues where we might find people who could help.

